  "prefLabel": "Pdab 203.01 Settlement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pdab 203.01 Settlement.\n\n(a) Settlements between the parties shall be encouraged in accordance with RSA 541-A:38.\n\n(b) Parties shall attempt to settle a matter before it is scheduled for a hearing and may settle a matter at any stage of the proceedings.\n\n(c) All settlement agreements shall:\n\n(1) Be in writing, describing the agreement's material terms; and\n\n(2) Be signed by both parties and their attorneys or agents.\n\nSource. #13500-A, eff 12-2-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pdab100-300.html"
